1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Five deadlines land on the same Friday.
五个截止日，挤在同一个周五。

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
My calendar lists every date.
日历会告诉我哪天到期。

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
It never tells me what to start today.
却不会说今天该开始什么。

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
So I turned my semester into a weather forecast.
所以我给学期做了一份天气预报。

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Every unfinished deadline adds pressure to the days before it.
每件未完成的事，都会给截止前的日子加压。

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Clear skies, or a black rainstorm — the city shows how heavy this week is.
晴天或黑色暴雨，城市显示这一周有多重。

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Next storm: the first high-load day in thirty days.
下一场风暴：未来三十天第一个会塌的日子。

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000
One task, chosen by preparation window, not by deadline alone.
一件事：按准备窗口排序，而不是只看截止日。

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
The whole semester at a glance.
一屏看完整个学期。

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The further out, the vaguer it gets — a forecast should admit that.
越远越模糊，预报本来就该承认这一点。

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
An exam is not something I submit.
考试没法提交。

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
So I track preparation instead, kept separate from the workload score.
所以我记录准备度，单独计算，不假装勾掉就减负。

13
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Every schedule is different.
每个人的学期都不一样。

14
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
So weights and preparation windows are mine to adjust.
权重和准备窗口都能自己调。

15
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Now the part that actually matters: finishing the work.
接下来才是重点：把事情做完。

16
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Each completed deadline removes its pressure.
每勾掉一件，它带来的负担就消失。

17
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:54,000
The city clears as I work through them.
一件件做完，城市一点点放晴。

18
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The forecast becomes feedback.
预报变成了反馈。

19
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Existing calendars import too — in the browser, no account.
已有的日历也能导入，全部在浏览器里，不用注册。

20
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:18,000
A generic island, or Hong Kong with its warning signals.
通用岛，或者带风球信号的香港。

21
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:27,000
This is a planning tool, not a diagnosis.
这是规划工具，不是诊断。

22
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:35,000
See the storm early. Choose your next step.
提前看见风暴，然后从一件事开始。
